{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible then approach, take, check properties, move and complete task, else scan area or move to next destination.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextDestination    />",
